/**
 * @mainpage Music Composition Core
 *
 * MCC is a portable C++17 music-composition library reconstructed on top of
 * Foundation. This initial `0.1.0` scaffold establishes the build, package,
 * test, example, export, and documentation contracts before legacy musical
 * concepts are migrated.
 *
 * @section MCCMainDependency Dependency
 *
 * MCC consumes the exported CMake target `Foundation::Foundation`. Each MCC
 * preset must use a Foundation package built for the same platform,
 * architecture, compiler ABI, and configuration policy.
 *
 * @section MCCMainNext Migration Direction
 *
 * Legacy notes, pitches, intervals, scales, MIDI representations, and related
 * utilities will be audited individually. Old code is reference material, not
 * an API compatibility promise.
 */
